{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/Group_1000004720.png?t=1748935857\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/Group_1000004718.png?t=1748935857\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/Group_1000004719.png?t=1748935857\" />Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is currently in demo version.<br>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as 