 of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/Group_1000004719.png?t=1748935857\" />Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is currently in demo version.<br>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended.<br>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your feedback is always welcome.<br>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>","developers":["PPPG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/4c37bc69189a27efa24304117f9d30bf86bdb02d/header.jpg?t=1748935857","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146989,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146989/movie480.mp4?t=1748922990","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146989/movie_max.mp4?t=1748922990"},"name":"Chord The Loudest Hero / Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146989/